 "intro_zh": "黄山被世人誉为“天下第一奇山”，素以奇松、怪石、云海、温泉著称于世，历来享有“五岳归来不看山，黄山归来不看岳”的美誉。",
 "intro_en": "Huangshan is known as \"the most amazing mountain in the world\". It is famous for its strange pines, strange rocks, sea of ​​clouds and hot springs. It has always enjoyed the reputation of \"when you come back from the Five Mountains, you don't see the mountains, and when you come back from Huangshan, you don't see the mountains.\"",
 "tip_zh": "前山后山各一天，山顶住宿需提前预订。",
